@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1/tasks

### Listar tareas
GET {{baseUrl}}
Accept: application/json

### Filtrar tareas
GET {{baseUrl}}?status=TODO&project=TaskFlow
Accept: application/json

### Obtener tarea existente
GET {{baseUrl}}/1
Accept: application/json

### Obtener tarea inexistente: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/999
Accept: application/json

### Crear tarea: 201
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Agregar rutas",
  "status": "TODO",
  "project": "TaskFlow"
}

### Crear tarea inválida: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Actualizar tarea
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Diseñar API REST actualizada",
  "status": "DONE",
  "project": "TaskFlow"
}

### Actualizar tarea inexistente: 404
PUT {{baseUrl}}/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Tarea inexistente",
  "status": "TODO"
}

### Eliminar tarea: 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/3

### Eliminar tarea inexistente: 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/999
